  "prefLabel": "Jus 804.01 Date of Issuance or Filing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 804.01 Date of Issuance or Filing. All written documents governed by these rules shall be rebuttably presumed to have been issued on the date noted on the document and to have been filed with the agency on the actual date of receipt by the agency, as evidenced by a date stamp placed on the document by the agency in the normal course of business.\n\nSource. #7129, eff 5-3-00",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus800.html"
